# Service

Tech capability, no SQL. `{Context}Service`. Wired in [api](./api.mdc).

## Logic

- How: hash, crypto, format, calculations the use-case would otherwise do inline
- Usually not workflow policy (“email must be unique”) → [application](./application.mdc). Exception: the same module policy used by multiple use-cases → small service here, inject from [container](./container.mdc) (not `application/*.util.ts`)
- A write that changes state records it via `AuditLogService` in the same transaction (`withTx`)

## Do

- Methods like `hashPassword`, `verifyPassword`

## Don't

- DB / repository / oRPC
- Call from [router](./router.mdc)

```ts
export class AuthService {
  async hashPassword(plain: string): Promise<string> {
    return await bcrypt.hash(plain, ROUNDS);
  }
}
```
